  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.09 Habitat determined to be critical",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.09 “Habitat determined to be critical” means a geographical area of land or waters designated by the executive director of the department that currently provides or historically provided physical or biological features essential to the conservation of an endangered or threatened species.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
